Sleep until an hour: the act field `until` (tools/city/interiors.py writes it; sleep_night has until 7, minutes 480 as the
fallback). CityThingsModel.h reads it and Run() turns it into the minutes from now to the next such o'clock; citytest
gets UntilChecks (4 checks). Apply with: git apply tools/citysim/until.patch && bash tools/citysim/run.sh

